  "details": "with the addition of Face Tracking, if you want to have a locomotion layer, and some gesture for Sign Language, you don't have room to put everything in.\n\nBumping to 512 instead of 256 would bump the max sync traffic (81 players on the map) for the parameters from somewhere in the neighborhood of 25kB/s to somewhere around 50kB/s, which seems not that expensive with modern internet connections.\n\nPlease don't upvote this feedback, go upvote https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/can-we-get-even-more-parameters-please",
